<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Surplus food, matched to the neighbors who need it.</h1>
  <p>
    FoodBridge helps small grocers, restaurants, farms, and caterers list surplus food in
    minutes, and helps local food banks, shelters, and pantries find and claim it before it
    goes to waste. No enterprise contract, no minimum volume — built for the organizations
    the bigger rescue platforms tend to skip.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="button-link" href="/register">Create a free account</a>
    <a class="button-link secondary" href="/listings">Browse available food</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how-it-works">
  <div class="card">
    <h2>1. Donors post</h2>
    <p>Restaurants, grocers, and farms list surplus food with a pickup window and location.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>2. Recipients claim</h2>
    <p>Food banks, shelters, and pantries browse listings sorted by distance and claim what they can use.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>3. Food gets picked up</h2>
    <p>The donor confirms the claim, hands off the food, and marks the listing complete.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
